{"title":"Wolf Pelt","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Wolf, Dire Wolf</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"wolf\" title=\"Wolf - dropped it in 13 of 35 looted corpses (1/3)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/b92e598cd76ddc4d4330.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Wolf</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/3<br>×1–4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"dire-wolf\" title=\"Dire Wolf - dropped it in 1 of 8 looted corpses (1/8)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/d535eb40d6ac5fcfceaa.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dire Wolf</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/8<br>×13</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"wolf-pelt\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/a24a0ceb9eeabaa06889.svg\" alt=\"Wolf Pelt\"></div><h3>Wolf Pelt</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>2 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/20/2026, 1:35:30 PM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}